  articleID: 'https://NewManilaCity/Events '
  title: Fiesta !
  headliner: '<b>Fiesta Fever: Streets Close As New Manila Prepares For Big Yearly
    Event</b>'
  bodyText: "Get ready for heavy traffic and lots of fun! Several main streets in
    the area are officially closing down starting today to make room for this year\u2019s
    massive neighborhood fiesta. Local workers are already out on the sidewalks setting
    up food stalls, game booths, and colorful decorations for the crowd. "
  textBeforeUrl: 'Link :'
  externalLinkBodyText: 'Commuters in New Manila are facing massive morning delays
    today after authorities abruptly shut down the main downtown expressway to make
    way for a grand street parade.

    The emergency road closure comes as the city
    prepares to host the annual International Sci-Fi Film Festival, which has officially
    taken over the central food court at the local shopping mall. Event organizers
    confirm that while no famous guests or celebrities will be attending this year''s
    low-key indoor screenings, dozens of local vendors have already set up pop-up
    tech Repair Booths along the quiet mall corridors.'
  hasExternalLink: 1
  customComments:
  - But there aren't any closed streets ? I live in the area.
  - I don't recall any announcements about a fiesta ?
  - Will there be balloons ?
